    "created_at": "2016-12-07T01:28:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-07T01:28:14Z",
    "body": "We generally moved away from default actions being a thing since the API doesn't see them that way. That is, the event flow works like this:\r\n```js\r\nif(target.dispatchEvent(event))\r\n  someAction()\r\n```\r\nSo _event_ cannot really know about the action that might occur unless we pass that along as state somehow.",
